sangati domain-ayurveda

  "panchabhootam-sthita spanda-kriya shuddhi-phala"
  "dhatu-yukta rasa-yukta rasayana-bandha-yukta"
  "sambandha-siddha kaizen-abheda svabhava-swarupa"
  "prana-yukta dosha-yukta ojas-yukta"
  "vata-yukta pitta-yukta kapha-yukta"
  "shiva-mooli-drishthanta samsarga-siddha"

  shabda panchabhootam, spanda, shuddhi, dhatu, rasa, rasayana-bandha, sambandha, kaizen, svabhava, prana, dosha, ojas, vata, pitta, kapha, shiva-mooli, samsarga

